            <title>[LU-19386] unable to configure multiple interfaces with certain yaml syntax</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19386</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In 2.15 you can import&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;net:
    - net type: tcp
      local NI(s):
        - interfaces:
              0: eth0
              1: eth1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;but with 2.16/master only the last interface ends up configured (eth1 in this example).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
